  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia is on a train. Dad is here. They sit at the window. The train is red. Mia has a teddy. It is small and brown.",
      "\"A cow!\" says Mia. The cow is black. It is big. \"Is it a horse?\" asks Dad. \"No, a cow,\" says Mia. Mia sees a horse. The horse is white. It is big too. Wow!",
      "A fly is on the window! It is black. It is small. \"Can it fly?\" asks Mia. \"Yes, it can,\" says Dad. \"Is it big?\" asks Dad. \"No, it is small,\" says Mia. Mia smiles. She likes the train."
    ],
    "summary": "Mia rides a train with Dad. She tells us the color and size of her teddy, a cow, a horse, and a small fly on the window.",
